	<para style="q1"><note caller="-" style="f"><char style="ft">Or, <char style="it">I am filled with ignominy, but look thou . . . for it increaseth: thou etc.</char></char></note><char style="w" x-id="t021" x-align="JOB.10.15.a013">Being</char> <char style="w" x-id="t022" x-align="JOB.10.15.a013" x-src="WLC.JOB.10.15.012" x-source="שְׂבַ֥ע" x-translit="śəḇaʿ" srcloc="WLC.JOB.10.15.012" x-head="true" lemma="שָׂבֵעַ" strong="H7649">filled</char> <char style="w" x-id="t023" x-align="JOB.10.15.a014">with</char> <char style="w" x-id="t024" x-align="JOB.10.15.a014" x-src="WLC.JOB.10.15.013" x-source="קָ֝ל֗וֹן" x-translit="qālôn" srcloc="WLC.JOB.10.15.013" x-head="true" lemma="קָלוֹן" strong="H7036">ignominy</char>,</para>
